Comedy connection: a comedian can deliberately induce a harmless form of conceptual proliferation.

Imagine:

> "My neighbour bought an emotional-support cactus."

The audience now starts constructing possibilities. Does the cactus have a therapist? Is it allowed on an aeroplane? Who supports whom? What would happen if you hugged it?

