### Discovery one: perception is shaped by expectation

Research in perceptual neuroscience finds that prior knowledge influences sensory processing and perceptual decisions. Predictive processing is an influential framework for explaining this, although there is ongoing debate about its precise neural implementation and explanatory scope.&#x20;

